### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or copy into Postman)
@host = http://localhost:3000
@key = change-me-to-a-long-random-string

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Create task (protected)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "title": "Finish Progree internship", "priority": 1, "status": "in_progress" }

### Create WITHOUT key -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Should fail" }

### Invalid data -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "status": "wrong" }

### List (public)
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?status=in_progress&page=1&limit=10

### Get one
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/1

### Update
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{key}}

{ "status": "done" }

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/tasks/1
x-api-key: {{key}}
